<title>USA: Ultrafem's INSTEAD to be distributed nationally.</title>
<headline>Ultrafem's INSTEAD to be distributed nationally.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultrafem Inc said Monday it reached agreements with both Dayton Hudson Corp's Target chain and Walgreen Co's Walgreens stores for national distribution of INSTEAD, its feminine protection product.</p>
<p>INSTEAD was developed as an alternative to tampons, Ultrafem said.</p>
<p>Target has begun shipping INSTEAD nationally to its 760-store chain, while Walgreens will begin national distribution in March, Ultrafem said.</p>
<p>Ultrafem gained 1-1/2 to 18-3/4.</p>
<p>(( New York newsdesk 212-859-1610 ))</p>
